      "content": "I am deeply saddened to hear that you are feeling such a crushing sense of helplessness and that the thought of choosing your own ending feels like a way to reclaim some dignity. This desire to take control when having it has been stripped away is incredibly painful, and it speaks to your deep need for autonomy and peace. Please know that your current emotional pain is valid, but seeking compassionate medical support now does not mean admitting defeat; it is a brave step toward ensuring your remaining time is as comfortable and under your care as possible before the inevitable outcome. You deserve to have your quality of life discussed openly and respectfully with your doctors without feeling judged or dismissed.",
